


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_9bb9086d:


    "女孩们躺回各自的床上后，继续聊起了当初刚搬进宿舍没多久时的事。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b3e1dd5b:


    "就连平常躺床后秒睡的圣夜子今天也都相当的炯炯有神。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_db1ffe95:


    "她似乎对自己窥视这个房间前三人之间所发生的事感到兴致勃勃。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_eab9b993:



    voice "2MI_0551"
    miyako "「——真是让人意外」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_8f5fab41:



    voice "2HI_0699"
    hina "「不过是真的啊。在伦敞开心扉之前花了更多心思和时间的其实是浅生哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_bd784cc4:



    voice "2MI_0552"
    miyako "「所以现在就……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_871fe7d0:



    voice "2HI_0700"
    hina "「对吧～完全被宠坏了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_85d2c88e:



    voice "2FU_0550"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_4a7ead71:



    voice "2HI_0701"
    hina "「说是因为双亲常年不在家，所以才不习惯被人照顾」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_f93fb466:


    "——去年的五月。早上，去学校之前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_095ea0cb:



    voice "2HI_0702"
    hina "「喂，再不出发的话赶不上公交车了啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_4be78a18:


    "个子虽然很小但声音却很洪亮，并且还掺杂着一些不耐烦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_8510c3d3:



    voice "2RI_0716"
    rin "「……你们先走就是啦，我等会就追上去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_90e36254:


    "这边则是有气无力的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a4325c28:


    "虽然换好了校服，伦又一晃一晃地往床铺飘去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_1e0a736d:



    voice "2HI_0703"
    hina "「之前你也说过类似的话，结果不是到了中午才来吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_dca7a100:



    voice "2RI_0717"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_401bd347:



    voice "2HI_0704"
    hina "「还不是因为你看书看太晚了所以早上才起不来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_752550ae:



    voice "2RI_0718"
    rin "「想做什么是别人的自由吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a90e22f7:



    voice "2HI_0705"
    hina "「才不是什么自由。作为室友和同班同学的我有义务不让你迟到！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_19e3d008:


    "阳菜说着便扯着伦的手打算把她扯起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_9c977631:



    voice "2RI_0719"
    rin "「……别扯啊，会变长的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_055550e1:



    voice "2HI_0706"
    hina "「那你就自己好好站起来啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_d938f902:



    voice "2RI_0720"
    rin "「……你是在攒分数吗，班长」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_8fd959b0:



    voice "2HI_0707"
    hina "「哈？什么分数啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_c11f3fa5:


    "伦站起来后两人的身高顿时高下立判。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_4c2c63f4:


    "然后互相瞪着对方，阳菜虽然个子较矮但完全不退缩。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_829b40c1:



    voice "2RI_0721"
    rin "「……哼」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_2b9866ea:


    "先别开视线的人是伦。接着甩了甩那被拽住的袖子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_0dff75ed:



    voice "2FU_0551"
    fumi "「好啦好啦，快点吧♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_3807087c:


    "在这剑拔弩张的气氛中,文突然插了话。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b80ea2c4:



    voice "2FU_0552"
    fumi "「给，这是手帕。我已经洗好了喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_2748773e:


    "文说着便递出了手帕。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_26c27f26:



    voice "2RI_0722"
    rin "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b93f5c02:


    "伦的视线在文的脸和她递出的手帕之间来回转换着，露出了懵圈的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_258ec635:



    voice "2RI_0723"
    rin "「话说，这种事……不做也无所谓的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b5b54783:



    voice "2FU_0553"
    fumi "「这只是我个人的自作主张而已。给，这是月票。给，这是便当」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_37d9bc51:


    "文脸上依旧保持着笑容并把物品逐个递给伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_ba062b86:



    voice "2RI_0724"
    rin "「诶，便当……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_548705d7:



    voice "2FU_0554"
    fumi "「嗯，我连大家的份都做好了♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_abd85853:



    voice "2HI_0708"
    hina "「应该会很好吃的哦，我现在就很期待了♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_48581100:


    "阳菜光是看着摆在便当里的菜肴就已经显得情绪高涨了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_0a8c86c5:



    voice "2FU_0555"
    fumi "「不如从今天起我们三人就一起吃午饭吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_1da1777c:



    voice "2RI_0725"
    rin "「诶……为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_49134eff:



    voice "2FU_0556"
    fumi "「因为我看你之前一直是独自离开教室吃午饭的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_90e12cb7:



    voice "2RI_0726"
    rin "「那是因为……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_cd92c2e1:



    voice "2HI_0709"
    hina "「绪方同学，你就陪我们吃一次吧。如果还是觉得不愿意的话那明天我们就不勉强你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_fdee91bc:



    voice "2RI_0727"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_8c3c60b9:


    "阳菜和文十分有耐心地等着伦的回答。毕竟这件事比赶不赶得上公车还重要。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_e5d416f7:



    voice "2RI_0728"
    rin "「……就仅限今天哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_04ee1225:



    voice "2FU_0557"
    fumi "「太好了！希望能合你的胃口」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b88d364d:



    voice "2RI_0729"
    rin "「……话说，我不喜欢吃青椒来着」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_269ef7e2:



    voice "2FU_0558"
    fumi "「不可以挑食喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_ffd398ee:



    voice "2MI_0553"
    miyako "「哇，绪方同学还有那样的时候啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b5b6c78e:



    voice "2HI_0710"
    hina "「性格别扭这点倒是一直没变哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_89fa33b0:



    voice "2MI_0554"
    miyako "「啊哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_bc9344e2:



    voice "2HI_0711"
    hina "「不过啊，从营造出宿舍现在这样的氛围到打开伦的心扉，全靠浅生她凭着那强韧的毅力坚持下来的哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_ad8f9087:



    voice "2MI_0555"
    miyako "「原来如此～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_2d7353cc:



    voice "2FU_0559"
    fumi "「是那么……一回事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_37d11e39:



    voice "2HI_0712"
    hina "「然而现在则是有点过火了，对伦宠溺得不行。像今天早上……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_93409271:


    "——当天早晨，上学前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b4d1cc9c:



    voice "2FU_0560"
    fumi "「快点，伦，快点起来。把书包拿好！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a800a9b6:


    "尽管每天给伦递东西已经到了驾轻就熟的地步，但如果不让伦先拿好书包的话那接下来的物品传递也没法进行。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_e1052bc7:



    voice "2RI_0730"
    rin "「我不。要文亲亲才起来！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_81ae9993:



    voice "2FU_0561"
    fumi "「唉？唉？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_f1e9339a:



    voice "2HI_0713"
    hina "「呜哇，变成宝宝了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_1a6af4be:



    voice "2FU_0562"
    fumi "「呃……那个，等回来之后我再亲你，总之你先起床吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_40d4214a:



    voice "2RI_0731"
    rin "「不行，现在就要亲」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_572a85e0:


    "真是任性的宝宝。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_2a505907:



    voice "2HI_0714"
    hina "「这可真要命……圣夜子你也说说她吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_6035d49e:



    voice "2MI_0556"
    miyako "「唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_8abce1ac:



    voice "2HI_0715"
    hina "「站着睡着了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_e21e6d0a:



    voice "2MI_0557"
    miyako "「啊哈哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a03e5694:


    "——笑出声的你其实也有点不妙呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_f8c3d483:



    voice "2HI_0716"
    hina "「所以说这家伙真的是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_36e01061:



    voice "2RI_0732RE"
    rin "「差不多就可以了吧，毕竟伦她是个非常纤细脆弱的女生嘛」" (show_name="文？")


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_530d27bd:



    voice "2HI_0717"
    hina "「浅生……？不对，声音明显是从浅生的被子里传出来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_100a9e52:



    voice "2FU_0563"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_97c5a3be:



    voice "2HI_0718"
    hina "「我还想着上铺怎么莫名安静的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_5dce0b21:


    "文的被子鼓了起来。伦在整个对话的过程中一直躲在那。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_1cc8bd8a:



    voice "2HI_0719"
    hina "「伦！快给我从浅生的被子里出来，要睡就回你自己的床铺睡去！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_75e4dcd0:



    voice "2RI_0733RE"
    rin "「伦她是个非常——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a7f402a9:



    voice "2HI_0720"
    hina "「别再说什么脆弱不脆弱啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_687db38c:



    voice "2RI_0734"
    rin "「唔唔唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_60a99ab0:


    "伦像毛毛虫一样从被窝里爬了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_fad95153:



    voice "2FU_0564"
    fumi "「趁还暖和的就赶紧回床上去吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_cd878c98:


    "文轻轻地敲了下伦的背后。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_a6ebdced:



    voice "2RI_0735"
    rin "「……我要文亲亲才回床去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_e4f5361d:



    voice "2FU_0565"
    fumi "「嗯～真拿你没办法呀……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_d500a495:



    voice "2RI_0736"
    rin "「呀呜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_651b0a3a:


    "阳菜扔的枕头命中了这个大宝宝的后脑勺。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_187005d9:



    voice "2HI_0721"
    hina "「给我回去！！」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_2f01e8e6:


    "——去年的五月。早上，去学校之前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_02_b4aa2936:


    "——当天早晨，上课前。"
